  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until almost tender, 10 minutes. Drain. TIP: The rice will continue cooking in step 4!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a822eae967f5a15022f49/step-9d2268ea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Trim and halve green beans. Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a822eae967f5a15022f49/step-8d27f53a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot and green beans, tossing, until almost tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add Asian greens and cook until wilted, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a822eae967f5a15022f49/step-081479d3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add drained rice and ginger paste to the pan and cook, stirring, until lightly browned and fragrant, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add char siu paste and the soy sauce, tossing, until coated, 1-2 minutes.\n• Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a822eae967f5a15022f49/step-23326ceb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, crack the eggs into the pan. Cook until egg whites are firm and yolks are cooked to your liking, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a822eae967f5a15022f49/step-1036facc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide char siu veggie fried rice between bowls. Top with fried egg.\n• Sprinkle with chilli and crispy shallots. Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a822eae967f5a15022f49/step-701eada1.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
